# Backend Standards (Python/FastAPI)

## Architecture
* Enforce 100% asynchronous execution for I/O bound operations (`async def`).
* Use SQLAlchemy 2.0 paradigms with async sessions.
* Strictly validate all incoming and outgoing data using Pydantic V2 models.
* Keep controllers (routers) extremely thin. Move business logic to dedicated service layers.

## Performance
* Optimize database queries to prevent N+1 fetching issues.
* Use connection pooling for both PostgreSQL and Redis.
* Never block the main event loop.
